@startuml Query Outbound Orders (Pending List / Detail)

title 取得尚未處理的出庫清單／出庫單明細（一般員工＋倉庫管理者用 WarehouseStaffOnly 版；總管理者另有跨倉庫版本）

actor "一般員工 / 倉庫管理者" as Staff
actor "總管理者" as Admin

box "Ordering.Api" #LightBlue
    participant "ListPendingOutboundOrdersEndpoint" as PendingEndpoint
    participant "GetOutboundOrderEndpoint" as DetailEndpoint
    participant "GetOutboundOrderForAdminEndpoint" as AdminDetailEndpoint
    participant "ICurrentUser" as CurrentUser
end box

box "Ordering.Application" #LightYellow
    participant "ISender" as Sender
    participant "ListPendingOutboundOrders\nQueryHandler" as PendingHandler
    participant "GetOutboundOrderQueryHandler" as DetailHandler
end box

box "Ordering.Infrastructure" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IOutboundOrderReader" as Reader
end box

database "ordering_db" as DB

== 待處理清單（限自己倉庫，只會看到已經是 Pending 的單，Processing 的單看不到）==
Staff -> PendingEndpoint : GET /api/v1/outbound/pending
PendingEndpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(ListPendingOutboundOrdersQuery())
Sender -> PendingHandler : HandleAsync(query, ct)
PendingHandler -> CurrentUser : WarehouseId
PendingHandler -> Reader : ListPendingAsync(currentUser.WarehouseId, ct)
Reader -> DB : select from outbound_orders\nwhere warehouse_id = @WarehouseId and status = 'Pending'
DB --> Reader : rows
Reader --> PendingHandler : IReadOnlyList<PendingOutboundOrderDto>
PendingHandler --> Staff : 200 OK

== 明細（限自己倉庫，可查任何狀態，包含 Processing/Rejected）==
Staff -> DetailEndpoint : GET /api/v1/outbound/{id}
DetailEndpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(GetOutboundOrderQuery(id))
Sender -> DetailHandler : HandleAsync(query, ct)
DetailHandler -> CurrentUser : WarehouseId
DetailHandler -> Reader : GetByIdAsync(id, currentUser.WarehouseId, ct)
Reader -> DB : select ... where id = @Id\nand (@WarehouseId is null or warehouse_id = @WarehouseId)
alt 這張單不屬於自己倉庫，或不存在
    Reader --> DetailHandler : Result.Failure
    DetailHandler --> Staff : 404 Not Found
else 找到
    Reader --> DetailHandler : OutboundOrderDto
    DetailHandler --> Staff : 200 OK
end

== 明細（跨倉庫，總管理者）==
Admin -> AdminDetailEndpoint : GET /api/v1/outbound/admin/{id}
AdminDetailEndpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(GetOutboundOrderQuery(id, warehouseId: null))
Sender --> Admin : 200 OK

@enduml
